# Prettier here is for code style only — single quotes, no trailing commas.
# Markdown is deliberately excluded: prettier pads every table cell to a fixed
# width and rewrites *emphasis* to _emphasis_, which makes the README hostile
# to hand-editing and produces enormous diffs for no gain.
*.md

# Generated or vendored.
.next/
node_modules/
package-lock.json
docs/screenshots/

# Local agent tooling, not part of the template (see .gitignore).
.claude/
.agents/
review-hooks/
